  "id": "sour-cream-coffee-cake",
  "name": "Sour Cream Coffee Cake",
  "subtitle": "A tender cake with cinnamon-walnut topping",
  "description": "A simple sour cream cake layered with a buttery cinnamon and walnut topping, finished with a lightly crisp surface.",
